,"Inspect the design document, progress notes, and reusable skill files.","The author reports using Codex CLI for the code, with skills, a design document, and browser checks. Human artists supplied assets; the author made the Tiled level.",[484,485,486],{"_52":481,"_27":482,"_19":278},{"_52":477,"_27":457,"_19":236,"_225":478},{"_52":472,"_27":473,"_225":474,"_276":277},{"_52":467,"_27":468,"_225":469},[427,118,494],"playwright-mcp","example:tower-of-time-ai-build","tower-of-time-ai-build","Tower of Time: prompting a rewind mechanic","A finished tower-defense game with time reversal and an extensive author-published prompt log covering mechanics, debugging, and polish.","/examples/tower-of-time-ai-build/",{"_21":496,"_23":497,"_25":498,"_108":420,"_90":113,"_265":268,"_262":558,"_9":559,"_246":560,"_20":561,"_34":562,"_221":563,"_215":564},[502,503,504,505,506,507,508,509,510,511,512,513,514,515,516,517,518,519,520],{"_50":23,"_54":497,"_56":23,"_58":-7},{"_50":112,"_54":498,"_56":25,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":266,"_54":420,"_56":108,"_58":59},{"_50":51,"_52":88,"_54":89,"_56":90,"_58":91},{"_50":51,"_52":263,"_54":264,"_56":265,"_58":87},{"_50":51,"_52":260,"_54":558,"_56":262,"_58":59},{"_50":207,"_52":252,"_253":254,"_62":553,"_56":9,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":247,"_62":549,"_56":246,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":244,"_54":548,"_56":246,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":242,"_54":547,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":237,"_62":543,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":235,"_54":236,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":229,"_62":538,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":227,"_54":228,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":219,"_62":533,"_56":221,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":213,"_62":528,"_56":215,"_58":-7},{"_50":207,"_56":208,"_52":209,"_62":525},{"_50":197,"_56":116,"_52":521,"_73":522,"_83":523,"_34":524,"_202":203,"_204":205,"_57":206},{"_50":51,"_56":194,"_52":195,"_54":196},"The playable battlefield behind the author’s rewind-mechanic prompts.","/GameMap/media/learning/tower-of-time-ai-build.webp","Tower of Time gameplay, showing a pixel-art space station, the player ship, an enemy, and base health.","https://m4v3k.itch.io/tower-of-time",[526,527],"Cursor","Augment Code",[529,530],{"_52":96,"_27":97},{"_52":531,"_27":532},"Phaser · Examples","/resources/phaser-examples/",[534],{"_52":535,"_27":536,"_225":537},"Read the AI contribution disclosure","https://github.com/maciej-trebacz/tower-of-time-game#vibe-coding-proof-of-concept","The author describes the AI tools used; the prompt log explicitly discloses manual code edits and scene work in Phaser Editor.",[539],{"_52":540,"_27":541,"_225":542},"Open the complete game project","https://github.com/maciej-trebacz/tower-of-time-game","Complete Phaser and TypeScript project with scenes, gameplay systems, image assets, music, sound effects, font files, and asset credits.",[544],{"_52":545,"_27":524,"_225":546},"Play Tower of Time","Choose Run game, then Start. Use arrow keys to move, Space for actions, and Backspace to rewind; gamepad controls are also available.","itch.io","prompt",[550],{"_52":551,"_27":552,"_225":-7},"Read the author’s prompt log","https://github.com/maciej-trebacz/tower-of-time-game/blob/main/PROMPTS.md",[554,555,556,557],"Play the game and try building defenses, surviving waves, and rewinding time.","Read the Rewindable Sprite prompts and the follow-up reports that refine the mechanic.","Trace how the author supplied file context, documentation, and observed errors to the agents.","Compare the prompt history with the complete project, including scenes, gameplay systems, and assets.","The author used Augment Code and Cursor agents, mainly with Claude Sonnet 4, while also editing code and arranging scenes in Phaser Editor.",[554,555,556,557],{"_52":551,"_27":552,"_19":548},{"_52":545,"_27":524,"_19":236,"_225":546},{"_52":540,"_27":541,"_225":542,"_276":277},{"_52":535,"_27":536,"_225":537},[118,565],"phaser-examples","example:clowder-and-crest-agents","clowder-and-crest-agents","